{"id":"415037723","kind":"article","title":"助记媒介提供专家编写的卡片来消除编写卡片的负担","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/The_mnemonic_medium_supplies_expert-authored_prompts_to_remove_the_burden_of_prompt-writing"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2021-09-28","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":585,"keywords":["助记媒介","间隔重复","记忆卡片","卡片设计","叙事结构"],"summary":"译文提出，助记媒介可由作者直接提供高质量卡片，降低间隔重复的制卡负担；但共享卡片通常难以脱离个人语境，作者认为把卡片嵌入叙事结构，或能改善学习他人卡片的效果。文中同时提醒，这种作者提供内容的模式可能带有隐含的权威主义问题。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/415037723","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"QxNtX-mn\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3ntJ7w9C3uapYp1m3gy2EK6PN788guzEoUNN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，但<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>通过提供作者编写的卡片，能够消除采用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的这一障碍，使读者不用自己写卡片就能记忆材料。</p><p data-pid=\"s3vcbNMw\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z38fLX4H8oq9eXKnZH7wk8qDXfBLg2bxVyA2M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，但我们相信助记媒介可以解决这个问题，只要更认真地对待卡片写作，并将卡片嵌入到叙事结构中 (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YjgWTaYfhWLrEbysgmDfFRcZ1yxgLeBeZac\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介赋予通常原子化的间隔重复记忆卡片以结构</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>)。这种方法有个重要的问题：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2SaePptX2K1sudevrMYrjaqP7ZBRLs82iSv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最初的助记媒介在前提上是隐含的威权主义</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"H7d0UuSE\">还要注意，这些卡片并不是孤立出现的：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zE1sr3TTDoEJut4hgai2w6qFUwBYHSkk7no\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介的卡片穿插在阅读体验中</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"B8ZHKyur\">当规模扩大时，这种方法可能有助于解决<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4zvsYb38iMhkDgZzKzjqpzKKtwPhvt4FuzcS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"IzdHuAZu\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a></li><li data-pid=\"tU_BXf1S\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"409992579\" href=\"#/post/409992579\">助记媒介可能通过提供作者创作的卡片来辅助卡片编写</a></li><li data-pid=\"7e8xx9gW\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium)</a></li><li data-pid=\"Q0ligj9n\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463608296\" href=\"#/post/463608296\">助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中</a></li><li data-pid=\"QZY6YTIu\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"481230325\" href=\"#/post/481230325\">助记媒介应该允许读者对他们收集的卡片进行控制</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"iEtfAfrH\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"5CXDC-sR\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/The_mnemonic_medium_supplies_expert-authored_prompts_to_remove_the_burden_of_prompt-writing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The mnemonic medium supplies expert-authored prompts to remove the burden of prompt-writing</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397271029\" href=\"#/post/397271029\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 助记媒介赋予通常原子化的间隔重复记忆卡片以结构 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397646854\" href=\"#/post/397646854\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 最初的助记媒介在前提上隐含着专制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"667506807\" href=\"#/post/667506807\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463608296\" href=\"#/post/463608296\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"399738674\" href=\"#/post/399738674\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"414517995","title":"接受助记媒介需要内容量达到临界值","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"452990774","title":"嵌入卡片模板可以主动辅助助记媒介读者编写卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":7,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"397245681","title":"写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"463608296","title":"助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"409992579","title":"助记媒介可能通过提供作者创作的卡片来辅助卡片编写","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}